    "text": "A capacitor of capacitance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> is charged to a potential <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>V</mi></math>. The flux of the electric field through a closed surface enclosing the positive plate of the capacitor is:",
