  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/619ab060-8335-46dc-af1a-d0b74288f0c0.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 128px;\" /><br />&nbsp;The charge enclosed is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>q</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi></math> &nbsp;</p><p>Gauss&#39; law states that the flux through any closed surface is equal to the charge enclosed by the surface.</p><p>&nbsp;Using Gauss&#39; law the flux is,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#981;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>q</mi><mtext>inc&#160;</mtext></msub><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><msub><mi>&#949;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced></math></p>",
